s nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-side via surface.paint\u001b[13;44H_overlays.\u001b[73X\u001b[14;44H4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode\u001b[15;44H; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode, which is d\u001b[16;44Heliberately avoided.\u001b[63X\u001b[17;44HFocused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_imm\u001b[18;44Hediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[9X\u001b[19;44HSuggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay\u001b[20;44H rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[35X\u001b[21;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;70m\n✓ Read-only analysis complete · transcript 58f46732e1c4\u001b[39m\u001b[28X\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[23;44H› Captured once; sanitized transcript replay; no provider session persisted.\u001b[39m\u001b[7X\u001b[24;44H\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[1;128H╭─ Claude Code · captured 2026-07-27\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;128H│ Explain why a 76x30 Railmux terminal uses the compact single-page projection whil\u001b[3;128He a 160x38 terminal remains in the ordinary wide sidebar-plus-agent layout. Cite th\u001b[4;128He exact responsive-layout symbols and\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[5;128H│ one existing focused test. Suggest one website-recorder assertion that prevents a\u001b[6;128H desktop demo from accidentally using compact mode.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[7;128H╰─ read-only source analysis\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[8;128H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\n• Read src/railmux/ui/workspace.py\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[10;128H• Read tests/test_agent_workspace.py\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[11;128H\u001b[K\u00